    {"if":{"allOf":[{"anyOf":[{"not":{"required":["profile"]}},{"properties":{"profile":{"const":"full"}}}]},{"allOf":[{"properties":{"workflow":{"const":"bug-diagnosis"}}},{"anyOf":[{"not":{"required":["experience"]}},{"properties":{"experience":{"const":"none"}}}]}]}]},"then":{"properties":{"requiredRoles":{"const":["debugger","code-reviewer"]}}}},
    {"if":{"allOf":[{"anyOf":[{"not":{"required":["profile"]}},{"properties":{"profile":{"const":"full"}}}]},{"allOf":[{"properties":{"workflow":{"const":"bug-diagnosis"}}},{"required":["experience"],"properties":{"experience":{"const":"focused"}}}]}]},"then":{"properties":{"requiredRoles":{"const":["debugger","code-reviewer","ux-reviewer"]}}}},
    {"if":{"allOf":[{"anyOf":[{"not":{"required":["profile"]}},{"properties":{"profile":{"const":"full"}}}]},{"allOf":[{"properties":{"workflow":{"const":"bug-diagnosis"}}},{"required":["experience"],"properties":{"experience":{"const":"full"}}}]}]},"then":{"properties":{"requiredRoles":{"const":["debugger","code-reviewer","product-designer","ux-reviewer"]}}}},
    {"if":{"allOf":[{"anyOf":[{"not":{"required":["profile"]}},{"properties":{"profile":{"const":"full"}}}]},{"allOf":[{"properties":{"workflow":{"const":"pr-review"}}},{"anyOf":[{"not":{"required":["experience"]}},{"properties":{"experience":{"const":"none"}}}]}]}]},"then":{"properties":{"requiredRoles":{"const":["code-reviewer","qa-executor","verifier"]}}}},
