    {"if":{"allOf":[{"anyOf":[{"not":{"required":["profile"]}},{"properties":{"profile":{"const":"full"}}}]},{"allOf":[{"properties":{"workflow":{"const":"incident"}}},{"required":["experience"],"properties":{"experience":{"const":"full"}}}]}]},"then":{"properties":{"requiredRoles":{"const":["incident-commander","debugger","qa-executor","verifier","product-designer","ux-reviewer"]}}}},
